---
title: M-Ranked — Rutube collection sequence
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as Scheduler
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant U as Rutube adapter
    participant RT as Rutube Public API
    participant P as Canonical pipeline
    participant R as Redis

    S->>DB: Read last completed Rutube run
    alt Rutube cadence has not elapsed
        S->>DB: Record skipped run reason
    else Collection is due
        S->>R: Acquire rutube partition lease
        S->>DB: Start collection_run and load enabled accounts
        loop For each account within account concurrency limit
            S->>U: collect(account)
            opt Native channel ID is missing
                U->>RT: GET configured public channel page
                RT-->>U: HTML containing numeric video/person ID
            end
            loop Paginated until discovery limit
                U->>RT: GET /api/video/person/{channelId}
                RT-->>U: Videos, publication time and views
            end
            U->>DB: Load bounded circular tracked page + refresh cursor
            U->>U: Select due videos, capped independently from discovery
            opt Due tracked video is outside discovery page
                U->>RT: GET /api/video/{videoId}?format=json
                RT-->>U: Exact video, 404/410, or non-authoritative error
            end
            par For each due video within request concurrency
                U->>RT: GET /api/numerator/video/{videoId}/vote
                RT-->>U: Positive votes or unavailable
            and
                U->>RT: GET /api/v2/comments/video/{videoId}
                RT-->>U: Comment count or unavailable
            end
            U->>P: Channel, discovered/refreshed videos, metrics and probes
            P->>P: Normalize absent likes/comments to NULL
            P->>P: Mark shares as unsupported NULL
            P->>P: Confirm deletion only from repeated exact-video 404/410
            P->>DB: Transactional metadata, snapshots, probes and refresh cursor
            DB-->>P: Commit with dataset revision
            P->>R: Publish revision.changed after commit
            P->>DB: Complete account result
        end
        S->>DB: Complete collection_run
        S->>R: Release/expire lease
    end

    Note over U,RT: Vote and comments requests fail independently,<br/>one unavailable metric must not erase another valid observation.
    Note over U,DB: Channel-list omission never means deletion.<br/>Auth/rate/transport/5xx keep the pending count unchanged.
